 "notes": [
  "Kit batch 2005+ (lane kit-batch-2005-20261121), hand-authored from the archived crops: panel 31 (N, 73.7 m, west part with the cantilever stack over bays 2-8) and panel 30 (N, 25.5 m, east end) from w01-352 2022-01-03 (straight-on, overcast); panel 28 (E end, 18.2 m) from w05-106 2025-07-31; panel 82 (E, Witte de Withplein, 38.5 m) from w03-79 2022-12-14; panel 44 (S, Witte de Withplein, 35.6 m, the 6-storey part over 19-29 m) from w04-172 2022-12-14; the four 10.8 m Admiralengracht corner faces (panels 8, 7, 14, 18) from w08-260, w07-260, w06-260 2020-05-11 and w09-260 2022-05-02. The Van Kinsbergenstraat front (panel 59) has no usable panorama and takes otherWalls with the courtyards.",
  "The cantilever balconies are balconyBands at the kit's deepest (0.7 of a storey, about 2.2 m); the photo's slabs are 3-4 m deep, wrap the saw-tooth corners and have sloping dark soffits, not modelled."
 ],
